WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.167
-Welcome back, everybody!

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.334
We're about to play
a fun new game,

00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:05.000
but first,
I'm gonna need some help.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.167
His new album,
"Twelve Carat Toothache,"

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:08.868
is out June 3rd.

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:10.434
And he's the musical guest
this weekend

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:11.968
on "Saturday Night Live."

00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:14.534
Please welcome Post Malone!

00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:16.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:22.834
♪♪

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:25.601
[ Speaking indistinctly ]

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:27.100
I missed you, dude.
-I missed you, too, Jimmy.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.701
-I missed you, bud.
Come on.

00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:30.868
That's my dude right there.
That's Post Malone.

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.601
[ Cheers and applause ]
That's my man.

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:34.300
Come on, bud.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.868
How you doing, bud?

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.267
-Thanks for being here.

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:40.000
Post, we're gonna play a game
called "Point, Turn, Sip."

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.100
-You got it.
-Here we go.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.033
-♪ Point, Turn, Sip ♪

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:46.801
♪ Point, Turn, and Sip ♪

00:00:46.801 --> 00:00:48.601
-All right.
Basically, it's a game

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:50.501
people play on TikTok.
It's a drinking game

00:00:50.501 --> 00:00:53.267
where I either swipe left,
right, up, or down,

00:00:53.267 --> 00:00:55.667
and you move your head left,
right, up, or down.

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:58.501
If we match, you drink.
If we don't, I drink.

00:00:58.501 --> 00:00:59.901
Okay, we're gonna sip beers.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:01.400
And since
you're a brand ambassador,

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:03.234
whoever takes more sips
each round

00:01:03.234 --> 00:01:05.167
gets to do a shot of Jager.
-What?!

00:01:05.167 --> 00:01:06.400
-Yeah, a little Jager
right there.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.601
Okay, here we go.
Let's start this.

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:08.667
I'm gonna go first. Okay?
-Okay.

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:09.667
-Let's get into position
right here.

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:10.834
-Okay.
-All right, Roots,

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:12.200
whenever you're ready.
-And I'm trying to match

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.968
where you're going.
-You're trying to not match.

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:14.968
-Not match?
-Not match.

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:16.601
-Okay.
-Ready?

00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:18.434
♪♪

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:20.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:29.367
♪♪

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:31.901
-I've already --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:35.300
♪♪

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.100
-No!
You're good at this game, Jimmy.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.234
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:40.367
-Fantastic, all right.

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:42.033
2-2, all right.
-That's pretty good.

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:44.267
-That's not bad.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:44.267 --> 00:01:46.701
-Tie on that one.
That's not -- you see what's up?

00:01:46.701 --> 00:01:48.734
-Yes, sir.
-Well, I should do a shot.

00:01:48.734 --> 00:01:50.400
I forgot, I have to do this.
-Wait -- oh, wait.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.367
We both get to do it.
-Oh, we tied.

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:53.467
-Hey, all right.
-Good to see you, bud.

00:01:53.467 --> 00:01:58.467
-Yeah, we did --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:58.467 --> 00:02:00.701
-Whoo-whoo!

00:02:00.701 --> 00:02:03.167
Ru-ruff! Ruff! Ruff!

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:05.067
All right, here we go bud.
-You got it, Jimmy.

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:06.334
-Next round,
it's up to you, bud.

00:02:06.334 --> 00:02:07.834
All right, here we go.
You do it.

00:02:07.834 --> 00:02:12.133
♪♪

00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:14.968
-Oh!
[ Laughs ]

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.767
-Aah!
-Hey!

00:02:16.767 --> 00:02:18.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.734
♪♪

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:24.634
-There you go.
-You drink.

00:02:24.634 --> 00:02:25.667
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:27.167
[ Buzzer ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.167 --> 00:02:28.534
-I was asking you to drink.
-I was dancing. I was --

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.901
-Yeah, into the groove
right there.

00:02:30.901 --> 00:02:32.868
Do I get the lead there?

00:02:32.868 --> 00:02:34.601
Yeah, I think -- I won that one.
So you take the shot, bud.

00:02:34.601 --> 00:02:36.167
-Oh, I forgot to sip, too.

00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:37.767
-Yeah, you forgot the sip
and the shot.

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:39.334
There you go.
That's for you, bud.

00:02:39.334 --> 00:02:40.601
-You're good at this game.
-Thank you.

00:02:40.601 --> 00:02:41.868
I'm pretty much a pro, yeah.

00:02:41.868 --> 00:02:43.634
[ Air horn blares ]

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:45.100
You know what
that air horn means?

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.400
-Of course.
-Party, first of all.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.467
[ Laughter ]
There's a party somewhere.

00:02:49.467 --> 00:02:50.868
It also means it's time
for the bonus round.

00:02:50.868 --> 00:02:52.300
-Of course.
-Yeah.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.400
All right, for this last round,
we're gonna up the stakes,

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.601
and we're gonna do alternate
pointing and head turning

00:02:56.601 --> 00:02:58.367
as fast as we can.
-All right.

00:02:58.367 --> 00:02:59.734
-I feel like I'm gonna do
a lot of drinking here.

00:02:59.734 --> 00:03:01.200
All right.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.701
First of all, I want to say
I love you.

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:04.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:07.133
You're my favorite dude.
-Jimmy, I love you, too, man!

00:03:07.133 --> 00:03:09.834
-I love you, dude!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.834 --> 00:03:11.968
All right, here we go.
I'll point first.

00:03:11.968 --> 00:03:13.634
Roots, whenever you're ready.

00:03:13.634 --> 00:03:17.801
♪♪

00:03:17.801 --> 00:03:19.934
-Ooh.

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:21.133
♪♪

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:23.767
[ Cheers ]

00:03:23.767 --> 00:03:27.033
Oh, I got it!

00:03:27.033 --> 00:03:30.167
-Wait.
What am I doing?

00:03:30.167 --> 00:03:34.167
-Aah! Okay.

00:03:34.167 --> 00:03:35.901
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:35.901 --> 00:03:37.834
-I won, yes!
-What the hell --

00:03:37.834 --> 00:03:39.467
-That's exactly
the way to do it!

00:03:39.467 --> 00:03:42.701
How do I do it like that?
-What's going on here?

00:03:42.701 --> 00:03:44.767
-That is for you, bud.

00:03:44.767 --> 00:03:47.601
-Jimmy was so quick to push this
right up in front of me.

00:03:47.601 --> 00:03:49.100
He goes,
"Don't forget about this, man."

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.334
-I'll do one, I'll do one.
I know -- I'll do one with you.

00:03:50.334 --> 00:03:51.434
Just 'cause
it's good to see you.

00:03:51.434 --> 00:03:52.434
-Cheers, guys.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:52.434 --> 00:03:53.767
-Post Malone right there.

00:03:53.767 --> 00:03:55.501
I love a good Jagermeister.

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:57.501
Stick around with more Post
after the break.

00:03:57.501 --> 00:03:58.767
Stick around.
Come on back, everybody.

00:03:58.767 --> 00:04:00.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

